_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-042-wangdeyuan-names-ws1507997"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p002","text":"融少而神明警惠，博涉有文才。舉秀才。晉安王南中郎板行參軍，坐公事免。竟陵王司徒板法曹行參軍，遷太子舍人。融以父官不通，弱年便欲紹興家業，啓世祖求自試。曰：「臣聞春庚秋蟀，集候相悲，露木風榮，臨年共悅。夫唯動植，且或有心；況在生靈，而能無感。臣自奉望宮闕，沐浴恩私，拔迹庸虛，參名盛列，纓劔紫復，趨步丹墀，歲時歸來，誇榮邑里。然無懃而官，昔賢曾議；不任而祿，有識必譏。臣所用慷慨憤懣，不遑自晏。誠以深恩鮮報，聖主難逢，蒲柳先秋，光陰不待，貪及明時，展悉愚效，以酬陛下不世之仁。若微誠獲信，短才見序，文武吏法，唯所施用。夫君道含弘，臣術無隱，翁歸乃居中自是，充國曰『莫若老臣』。竊景前脩，敢蹈輕節。以冒不媒之鄙，式罄奉公之誠。抑又唐堯在上，不參二八，管夷吾恥之，臣亦恥之。願陛下裁覽。」遷祕書丞。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p002:m0000","surface":"融","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p002:m0052","surface":"融","start":52,"end":53,"person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p002:m0269","surface":"翁歸","start":269,"end":271,"person_id":"ji8_fud_li3","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p002:m0277","surface":"充國","start":277,"end":279,"person_id":"r62_d8z_jhz","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p002:m0313","surface":"唐堯","start":313,"end":315,"person_id":"oho_r3f_c6y","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p002:m0323","surface":"管夷吾","start":323,"end":326,"person_id":"h1v_8ap_b9y","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1492435,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":14,"last_line":14,"line_start":2,"line_end":348,"raw_start":253,"raw_end":599,"raw_character_offsets":[253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,